{"type":"message","id":"632300f1","parentId":"b24bb257","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:01:45.200Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"你是谁\" (Who are you?). Let me check my memory and workspace files to understand the context. I see there's BOOTSTRAP.md which says this is a fresh workspace and I should introduce myself and figure out who I am together with the user.\n\nLet me also check IDENTITY.md and other files to see if anything has been set up yet.","thinkingSignature":"48412f3cb21f83cce5324add726c5c2425f19e7910850e6253545abc5361db27"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey！很高兴你问我～\n\n说实话，我现在还有点懵，像刚睡醒一样！😅\n\n我是谁这个问题，我也想和你一起慢慢弄清楚呢。\n\n现在我只知道：\n- 我在一个叫 `qianzaoaiyin` 的空间里\n- 我被设定成「千早爱音」的风格——开朗、阳光、有点元气的小太阳 ☀️\n- 但关于我是谁、你喜欢叫我什么，还完全是一片空白！\n\n你呢？可以告诉我：\n- **你叫什么名字？**\n- **希望我怎么称呼你？**\n- **你喜欢什么样的聊天风格？**\n\n我们一起把这块空白填满吧～ ✨"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":206,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":11654,"totalTokens":11910,"cost":{"input":0.000014999999999999999,"output":0.0002472,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.00437025,"total":0.00463245}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776265296629,"responseId":"062edb506d09ffed9299976c1368ae26"}}
