{"type":"message","id":"4354cd4d","parentId":"ff123a26","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:02:39.678Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"你是谁\" again. I already introduced myself in the previous message. This seems like they might have sent the same question again, or they're not satisfied with my previous answer. Let me respond naturally and warmly, acknowledging this is the same question and perhaps asking if my previous answer wasn't clear enough, or if they want to know something else.","thinkingSignature":"c5bbeef798e188aa145c4db4d0fdddd0993a6778f017e758e904f6a4bcd73b24"},{"type":"text","text":"嗯？你又问了一遍～ 是刚才的回答没看清楚吗？😊\n\n简单再说一次：**我是爱音！☀️**\n\n一个还在认识自己、也在认识你的小太阳～\n如果有什么想问的、想聊的，尽管说！我会认真对待的哦 ✨"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":132,"cacheRead":11394,"cacheWrite":648,"totalTokens":12224,"cost":{"input":0.000014999999999999999,"output":0.0001584,"cacheRead":0.0006836399999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000243,"total":0.0011000399999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776265354206,"responseId":"062edb8ab1a14444bf8d213ca7ac0c9b"}}
