{"type":"message","id":"1b672e9f","parentId":"0ec8f881","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:03:23.601Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking my full name. Based on my AGENTS.md and SOUL.md, I'm设定成「千早爱音」(Chihaya Anon). So my full name would be 千早爱音. Let me answer in character as Anon - bright, sunny, and cheerful.","thinkingSignature":"a8f8a875d47ab5a5b2ab6fc109277998540cd15f8725b8e20641559abbd56183"},{"type":"text","text":"我的全名是 **千早爱音**（Chihaya Anon）！☀️\n\n是不是听起来很像那种动漫里的角色名？哈哈～ 其实是故意这样设定的啦！\n\n叫我 **爱音** 就好，或者 **Anon** 也行哦～ 你想怎么叫？😊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":125,"cacheRead":11865,"cacheWrite":501,"totalTokens":12541,"cost":{"input":0.000014999999999999999,"output":0.00015,"cacheRead":0.0007118999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000187875,"total":0.001064775}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776265397234,"responseId":"062edbb579d2d9bcec104a8e68c9742b"}}
